{"id":"arrache_","lemma":"arraché","pos":"adj","rank":3248,"glosses":["erased"],"ipa":"/a.ʁa.ʃe/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/84/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-VictorDtmtc-arrach%C3%A9.wav","examples":[{"text":"Il a arraché sa chemise.","en":"He ripped his shirt open.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"his"},{"g":"shirt"}]},{"text":"On m'a arraché une dent.","en":"I had a tooth pulled.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/45757","words":[{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"tooth"}]},{"text":"Le policier a arraché une arme au meurtrier.","en":"The policeman wrested a gun from the murderer.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"policeman"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"weapon"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"deadly"}]},{"text":"Le vent a arraché le toit de notre immeuble.","en":"The wind ripped the roof off our building.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"wind"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"roof"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"our"},{"g":"building"}]},{"text":"J'ai arraché la photo de l'album.","en":"I tore the picture out of the album.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"photo"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"album"}]}]}